# Proxmox Setup

## Purpose

Proxmox provides the virtualization layer for all lab infrastructure.

## Hardware

- Small-form-factor nodes (Lenovo ThinkCentre M910q)
- Clustered for experimentation and scalability

## Responsibilities

- Hosting virtual machines
- Managing compute resources
- Supporting snapshots and rollback
- Integrating with shared storage

## Networking

- Uses bridged networking to connect VMs to pfSense
- Supports VLAN-aware configurations

## Notes

- Node-specific IPs and credentials are not stored in this repository.
